<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND BEAT SRI LANKA BY 29 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND BEAT SRI LANKA BY 29 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand</p>
<p>beat Sri Lanka by 29 runs in the opening match of the Singer</p>
<p>Champions' Trophy tournament on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 206-8 (50 overs). Sri Lanka 177 (49.1</p>
<p>overs).</p>
</text>
